   "source": [
    "## Identifying High-Value Customers\n",
    "\n",
    "The table above ranks customers by their predicted Customer Lifetime Value (CLV).\n",
    "\n",
    "Customers with the highest predicted CLV typically exhibit two characteristics:\n",
    "\n",
    "• higher historical purchase frequency  \n",
    "• higher average transaction value\n",
    "\n",
    "Although the predicted number of future purchases is modest, the high expected transaction value leads to higher overall lifetime value. These customers represent the most valuable segment of the customer base and are ideal candidates for targeted retention and loyalty strategies."
   ]
